,title,link,text,language,family
0,Chibchan languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chibchan_languages,"The Chibchan languages (also known as Chibchano) are a language family indigenous to the Isthmo-Colombian Area, a geo-cultural region extending from Mosquitia in eastern Central America to northern Colombia, and encompassing parts of Costa Rica and Panama.","Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
1,Uwa language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uwa_language,"The Uwa language, Uw Cuwa, commonly known as Tunebo, is a Chibchan language spoken by between 1,800 and 3,600 of the Uwa people of Colombia, out of a total population of about 7,000.","Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
2,Diccionario Tunebo » Introduction,https://www.webonary.work/tunebo/overview/introduction/?lang=en,Adolfo Constenla Umaña notes the relationship between the Uw cuwa (Tunebo) and the music that was identified as belonging to the Chibchan Linguistic Family by Max Uhle in 1888.,"Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
3,Central Tunebo U’wa - Max Planck Society,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Tunebo-Central.htm,"Tunebo is a tonal language with two tonesː high tone with an acute mark v́ and low tone unmarked, and note the following conversions between traditional phonetic symbols and IPA transcriptionsː 1. c = IPA [k], 2. y = IPA [j]","Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
4,"Tunebo, Central Language (TUF) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/tuf/,Central Tunebo is a stable indigenous language of Colombia. It belongs to the Chibchan language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
5,OLAC resources in and about the Central Tunebo language,http://www.language-archives.org/language/tuf,"ONLINEIntroducción al tunebo: 11 lecciones con el propósito de ayudar a aquellos que puedan estar interesados en empezar a aprender este idioma. Headland, Edna. 1977.","Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
6,"Tunebo, Central | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/tuf/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..X2YlAnZMeqvWLNrossK7lERbgX98SprgQ1T_ROZPul0,Central Tunebo is a stable indigenous language of Colombia. It belongs to the Chibchan language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
7,Central Tunebo - tuf (Chibchan) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/tuf/,"Central Tunebo (tuf) is part of the Chibchan family and Chibchan, Chibchan B, Eastern Chibchan, Colombian, Southern Colombian, Cundicocuyese class. Central Tunebo speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts","Tunebo, Central",Chibchan
